1
00:00:51,460 --> 00:00:52,460
=As Promised=

2
00:00:52,460 --> 00:00:53,980
(Adapted from "The Villain's Guide to Love",
a story on Zhihu Yanyan)

3
00:00:54,060 --> 00:00:56,900
=Episode 13=

4
00:00:56,980 --> 00:00:58,940
(Wenhua Hall)

5
00:01:11,710 --> 00:01:12,640
Yu Feilin?

6
00:01:13,040 --> 00:01:13,760
Why are you here?

7
00:01:34,280 --> 00:01:35,150
Xiaoyuan,

8
00:01:35,400 --> 00:01:36,430
I've wronged you.

9
00:01:36,560 --> 00:01:37,430
Your Highness.

10
00:01:47,430 --> 00:01:48,680
Have you forgotten?

11
00:01:48,680 --> 00:01:50,070
Last night, He Xiaoyuan

12
00:01:50,070 --> 00:01:51,430
wasn't in the bridal chamber at all.

13
00:01:51,950 --> 00:01:53,150
You were drunk.

14
00:01:53,760 --> 00:01:55,070
You were the one who took my hand...

15
00:01:57,430 --> 00:01:58,950
Xiaoyuan and I love each other.

16
00:01:59,350 --> 00:02:00,150
On our wedding night,

17
00:02:00,430 --> 00:02:01,350
why would she leave?

18
00:02:01,840 --> 00:02:02,640
Yu Feilin,

19
00:02:03,040 --> 00:02:04,510
do you take me for a fool?

20
00:02:07,120 --> 00:02:07,920
But I clearly saw

21
00:02:07,920 --> 00:02:10,080
He Xiaoyuan run away
with the Seventh Prince.

22
00:02:16,030 --> 00:02:17,080
Your Highness,

23
00:02:17,240 --> 00:02:18,430
please see the truth.

24
00:02:18,560 --> 00:02:20,000
The Seventh Prince
harbors treacherous ambitions.

25
00:02:20,120 --> 00:02:21,030
He Xiaoyuan

26
00:02:21,120 --> 00:02:22,560
was clearly a pawn

27
00:02:22,560 --> 00:02:23,590
he planted by your side.

28
00:02:24,000 --> 00:02:25,960
I've already given myself to you.

29
00:02:25,960 --> 00:02:27,240
There's no turning back for me now.

30
00:02:28,120 --> 00:02:28,750
Your Highness,

31
00:02:29,400 --> 00:02:30,710
only the Yu family

32
00:02:30,710 --> 00:02:32,470
can help secure
your position as Crown Prince

33
00:02:32,590 --> 00:02:34,240
and win the support
of the court officials.

34
00:02:34,240 --> 00:02:34,630
Your Highness.

35
00:02:34,630 --> 00:02:35,470
Enough!

36
00:02:37,680 --> 00:02:39,080
Xiaoyuan loves me deeply.

37
00:02:39,360 --> 00:02:41,030
She would never run away with Boqing.

38
00:02:41,470 --> 00:02:44,080
You went to such lengths
to replace my Crown Princess

39
00:02:44,630 --> 00:02:46,000
just to make me

40
00:02:46,000 --> 00:02:47,710
recognize you
as my rightful consort, didn't you?

41
00:02:48,120 --> 00:02:49,840
I won't give you what you want.

42
00:02:50,430 --> 00:02:51,080
Guards!

43
00:02:54,240 --> 00:02:55,240
Your Highness!

44
00:02:55,240 --> 00:02:57,150
That vile He Xiaoyuan
doesn't love you at all.

45
00:02:57,710 --> 00:02:58,680
I'm the only one who truly loves you.

46
00:02:58,680 --> 00:03:00,120
The Yu family failed
to discipline their daughter

47
00:03:00,120 --> 00:03:01,360
- and let her deceive the Crown Prince.
- Your Highness!

48
00:03:01,430 --> 00:03:02,520
The entire family

49
00:03:03,000 --> 00:03:03,840
is to be imprisoned immediately.

50
00:03:04,680 --> 00:03:05,360
Your Highness!

51
00:03:06,520 --> 00:03:06,870
Move.

52
00:03:06,960 --> 00:03:07,840
Your Highness!

53
00:03:09,080 --> 00:03:09,960
Your Highness!

54
00:03:13,310 --> 00:03:14,000
Zhuguang.

55
00:03:14,280 --> 00:03:15,630
Take me to Qingyan Palace at once.

56
00:03:19,240 --> 00:03:20,280
Why bother catching them in the act now,

57
00:03:20,280 --> 00:03:20,960
Your Highness?

58
00:03:21,630 --> 00:03:23,630
We're in danger ourselves.

59
00:03:24,310 --> 00:03:25,240
Your Highness, please get changed

60
00:03:25,360 --> 00:03:26,150
and come with us.

61
00:03:44,630 --> 00:03:45,360
So you've come.

62
00:03:46,680 --> 00:03:48,080
Did you really think

63
00:03:48,630 --> 00:03:49,750
I would go break into

64
00:03:49,750 --> 00:03:51,840
your heavily guarded prison
to rescue him?

65
00:03:52,710 --> 00:03:53,710
Your Highness.

66
00:03:54,750 --> 00:03:56,560
I have nothing left to lose.

67
00:03:57,030 --> 00:03:57,750
So why not

68
00:03:58,080 --> 00:03:59,150
go straight for the heart of it

69
00:03:59,590 --> 00:04:00,430
and raise the stakes?

70
00:04:01,960 --> 00:04:03,630
I was the Imperial Preceptor
of the former dynasty.

71
00:04:04,030 --> 00:04:05,280
Across this vast realm,

72
00:04:05,680 --> 00:04:07,590
what part of it
did I not shed blood for,

73
00:04:07,870 --> 00:04:08,630
giving my all in service?

74
00:04:09,000 --> 00:04:10,960
This realm should
have been mine to rule.

75
00:04:11,470 --> 00:04:12,560
Yet you killed your father and brothers,

76
00:04:12,560 --> 00:04:13,520
usurped the throne,

77
00:04:14,630 --> 00:04:16,720
and confined me
to this dark Imperial Observatory.

78
00:04:17,270 --> 00:04:19,830
Have you forgotten who you are?

79
00:04:19,830 --> 00:04:20,870
All these years,

80
00:04:21,430 --> 00:04:22,920
I spared you

81
00:04:22,920 --> 00:04:24,390
and gave you a way to live.

82
00:04:25,070 --> 00:04:26,870
So Your Majesty knew all along.

83
00:04:26,870 --> 00:04:27,950
But you,

84
00:04:28,680 --> 00:04:30,510
just like that useless son of yours,

85
00:04:31,240 --> 00:04:32,870
are incapable of ruling this realm

86
00:04:33,270 --> 00:04:34,720
and unworthy of being Emperor.

87
00:04:40,920 --> 00:04:42,480
Choose, Your Highness.

88
00:04:42,560 --> 00:04:43,870
Sign the imperial edict

89
00:04:43,870 --> 00:04:44,870
and release my son.

90
00:04:44,870 --> 00:04:46,310
Then I'll allow you

91
00:04:46,310 --> 00:04:47,720
to fight me openly

92
00:04:48,270 --> 00:04:49,270
for another ten years

93
00:04:50,120 --> 00:04:51,430
and vie for this realm.

94
00:04:52,800 --> 00:04:53,800
If you refuse,

95
00:04:58,310 --> 00:04:59,720
your loved ones

96
00:05:00,480 --> 00:05:01,270
will be beheaded at once.

97
00:05:03,680 --> 00:05:04,600
Boqing.

98
00:05:06,260 --> 00:05:06,910
Don't!

99
00:05:07,630 --> 00:05:08,480
I'll sign it.

100
00:05:37,240 --> 00:05:38,040
Father.

101
00:05:39,070 --> 00:05:39,920
Good.

102
00:05:41,270 --> 00:05:42,000
Good.

103
00:05:44,120 --> 00:05:44,720
My son,

104
00:05:45,120 --> 00:05:46,190
watch closely.

105
00:05:48,870 --> 00:05:50,560
The Seventh Prince
has rebelled and killed the Emperor,

106
00:05:50,720 --> 00:05:52,240
slaughtering the Crown Prince
and the Princess.

107
00:05:52,630 --> 00:05:53,750
My son Fu Yang

108
00:05:54,560 --> 00:05:56,270
will purge the court
of this traitor as Prince Consort

109
00:05:56,480 --> 00:05:57,560
and put him to death.

110
00:05:58,310 --> 00:05:58,870
Do it.

111
00:05:59,000 --> 00:05:59,630
Spare no one!

112
00:06:08,950 --> 00:06:09,560
Fu Yang!

113
00:06:27,190 --> 00:06:28,600
Take him straight to the imperial prison

114
00:06:29,040 --> 00:06:30,000
to await judgment.

115
00:06:35,270 --> 00:06:36,120
Are you all right?

116
00:06:36,240 --> 00:06:37,040
I'm fine.

117
00:06:39,000 --> 00:06:40,190
The Crown Prince
has suffered a severe shock.

118
00:06:40,390 --> 00:06:41,630
Escort him back to the Eastern Palace.

119
00:06:42,240 --> 00:06:43,560
The Black Armor Army must stand guard

120
00:06:43,560 --> 00:06:44,390
around the clock,

121
00:06:44,390 --> 00:06:45,070
without fail.

122
00:06:45,190 --> 00:06:45,430
Yes.

123
00:06:45,830 --> 00:06:46,560
Your Highness.

124
00:06:47,190 --> 00:06:47,720
Quickly.

125
00:06:48,040 --> 00:06:48,270
Come.

126
00:06:48,630 --> 00:06:49,560
(Your Highness.)

127
00:06:50,190 --> 00:06:50,950
(I'm sorry.)

128
00:06:56,430 --> 00:06:57,310
I'm sorry...

129
00:06:57,870 --> 00:06:58,870
Fu Yang.

130
00:07:01,190 --> 00:07:02,390
For deceiving you for so long.

131
00:07:03,300 --> 00:07:06,330
♪It's all because I like you♪

132
00:07:06,820 --> 00:07:12,930
♪Only after walking far away
did I dare look back♪

133
00:07:13,070 --> 00:07:14,240
The jade pendant you gave me...

134
00:07:15,780 --> 00:07:18,080
♪Stubbornly writing down
the wrong answer♪

135
00:07:18,120 --> 00:07:18,920
I...

136
00:07:20,070 --> 00:07:20,870
I...

137
00:07:23,040 --> 00:07:23,560
love...

138
00:07:28,190 --> 00:07:30,070
Fu Yang!

139
00:07:31,430 --> 00:07:32,630
Fu Yang!

140
00:07:32,750 --> 00:07:34,000
"Guarding him day and night"?

141
00:07:34,630 --> 00:07:35,680
That's a fine way to put it.

142
00:07:35,680 --> 00:07:36,870
Isn't it just house arrest
and surveillance?

143
00:07:37,430 --> 00:07:39,600
The Seventh Prince
is taking the Crown Princess

144
00:07:40,190 --> 00:07:42,000
and the throne for himself.

145
00:07:42,430 --> 00:07:44,160
My poor Crown Prince.

146
00:07:44,160 --> 00:07:45,070
Perhaps it's better
that you're unconscious,

147
00:07:45,480 --> 00:07:47,120
so you don't have
to witness this awful scene.

148
00:07:49,140 --> 00:07:49,740
(In Memory of My Late Sister, He Dafang)

149
00:07:49,750 --> 00:07:50,430
(In Memory of My Father, He Jingchuan)
Father.

150
00:07:50,430 --> 00:07:51,240
(In Memory of My Late Mother, Zhang)

151
00:07:51,240 --> 00:07:51,750
Mother.

152
00:07:52,510 --> 00:07:53,040
Sister.

153
00:07:55,070 --> 00:07:56,480
Those responsible for your deaths

154
00:07:57,430 --> 00:07:58,750
have been brought
to justice and imprisoned.

155
00:07:59,510 --> 00:08:00,680
You can rest in peace now.

156
00:08:03,390 --> 00:08:03,920
Uncle.

157
00:08:04,950 --> 00:08:05,480
Aunt.

158
00:08:11,430 --> 00:08:13,560
I promise to keep
Xiaoyuan safe and secure

159
00:08:14,950 --> 00:08:15,800
for the rest of her life.

160
00:08:21,430 --> 00:08:22,920
How is your injury?

161
00:08:23,510 --> 00:08:24,480
These past few days,

162
00:08:24,830 --> 00:08:26,510
you haven't been looking well.

163
00:08:28,360 --> 00:08:29,120
I'm fine.

164
00:08:30,120 --> 00:08:30,800
By the way,

165
00:08:32,000 --> 00:08:33,720
didn't you want to take your family

166
00:08:34,240 --> 00:08:35,320
back home for burial?

167
00:08:36,080 --> 00:08:37,000
I've made arrangements

168
00:08:37,150 --> 00:08:37,960
for you to leave the palace.

169
00:08:38,630 --> 00:08:39,600
You can set off now.

170
00:08:41,630 --> 00:08:42,960
Are you

171
00:08:42,960 --> 00:08:44,510
hiding something from me?

172
00:08:46,440 --> 00:08:47,960
What could I possibly
be hiding from you?

173
00:08:49,080 --> 00:08:50,030
Right now,

174
00:08:50,320 --> 00:08:51,270
Father is gravely ill,

175
00:08:52,550 --> 00:08:53,870
the Princess is deeply troubled,

176
00:08:54,720 --> 00:08:55,960
and the Crown Prince has lost all heart.

177
00:08:57,080 --> 00:08:58,750
The palace will remain
unsettled for some time.

178
00:08:59,600 --> 00:09:00,270
I can't leave.

179
00:09:01,120 --> 00:09:03,150
It would do you good
to get away for a while.

180
00:09:17,790 --> 00:09:19,270
You carved this yourself?

181
00:09:23,630 --> 00:09:24,510
It's a long journey home.

182
00:09:25,360 --> 00:09:26,120
With this,

183
00:09:26,840 --> 00:09:27,630
just think of me

184
00:09:28,840 --> 00:09:29,630
as being with you all the way.

185
00:09:47,550 --> 00:09:49,270
(Do it. Spare no one.)

186
00:10:02,510 --> 00:10:03,630
(With this,)

187
00:10:03,840 --> 00:10:04,840
(just think of me)

188
00:10:05,910 --> 00:10:06,720
(as being with you all the way.)

189
00:10:31,550 --> 00:10:32,080
(Xiaoyuan,)

190
00:10:33,360 --> 00:10:34,600
(by the time you read this letter,)

191
00:10:35,200 --> 00:10:36,440
(you should already be standing
at the Nanshan courtyard)

192
00:10:36,440 --> 00:10:38,390
(where you can see
the entire starry sky.)

193
00:10:39,320 --> 00:10:40,600
(It's the place I chose for you.)

194
00:10:41,870 --> 00:10:43,000
(There's a raised terrace
in the courtyard)

195
00:10:43,630 --> 00:10:44,480
(where you can watch
the stars at night.)

196
00:10:45,360 --> 00:10:46,670
(The study is filled
with shelves of ink-making materials,)

197
00:10:46,960 --> 00:10:48,600
(enough for you to devote
your life to what you love.)

198
00:10:49,360 --> 00:10:50,240
(The farmland and property deeds)

199
00:10:50,840 --> 00:10:51,550
(have all been prepared.)

200
00:10:52,550 --> 00:10:54,960
(Once you ascend the throne)

201
00:10:55,120 --> 00:10:56,320
and have countless affairs
of state to attend to,

202
00:10:57,510 --> 00:10:58,480
you won't remember

203
00:10:58,480 --> 00:11:00,440
something as small
as watching the stars with me.

204
00:11:00,960 --> 00:11:02,320
When have I ever broken my word?

205
00:11:03,120 --> 00:11:03,840
Then pinky promise.

206
00:11:03,840 --> 00:11:04,670
It's a promise.

207
00:11:05,240 --> 00:11:06,270
(From now on,)

208
00:11:06,750 --> 00:11:07,630
(you won't have to hide anymore.)

209
00:11:07,960 --> 00:11:09,030
(You won't have to wake up afraid)

210
00:11:09,240 --> 00:11:10,480
(of being trapped in another cycle.)

211
00:11:11,030 --> 00:11:11,840
(Because this lifetime)

212
00:11:12,200 --> 00:11:13,750
(is the last cycle Zhixuan created)

213
00:11:14,000 --> 00:11:16,000
(by sacrificing himself
to disrupt time and space.)

214
00:11:16,550 --> 00:11:18,150
(For the rest of your life,
you can live as you wish.)

215
00:11:18,480 --> 00:11:19,200
(Don't look back.)

216
00:11:19,960 --> 00:11:20,720
(Don't wait for me.)

217
00:11:21,360 --> 00:11:22,360
(My)

218
00:11:22,960 --> 00:11:23,600
(final farewell.)

219
00:11:23,600 --> 00:11:25,910
(I really do love you.)

220
00:11:26,360 --> 00:11:27,750
(And your love for me)

221
00:11:28,550 --> 00:11:29,870
mustn't change for a hundred years.

222
00:11:32,200 --> 00:11:33,550
I wish I could be with you

223
00:11:36,670 --> 00:11:38,030
to watch the stars one more time.

224
00:11:41,200 --> 00:11:42,000
Stop the carriage.

225
00:11:42,600 --> 00:11:43,700
Turn around.
We're going back to the palace!

226
00:11:43,700 --> 00:11:45,840
♪The flickering lights
cast overlapping shadows♪

227
00:11:45,840 --> 00:11:48,540
♪Through each trial and thought,
the years pass by♪

228
00:11:48,650 --> 00:11:51,220
♪A cold blade gleams
against the frost and snow♪

229
00:11:51,500 --> 00:11:54,350
♪Unbroken♪

230
00:12:25,880 --> 00:12:28,200
♪My longing has nowhere to rest♪

231
00:12:28,560 --> 00:12:30,240
♪Through the storm, I drift and sway♪

232
00:12:30,880 --> 00:12:33,880
♪You are the prayer I hold in my palm♪

233
00:12:34,400 --> 00:12:38,720
♪In one frozen moment,
my tears come into focus♪

234
00:12:38,720 --> 00:12:41,480
♪My heart has long known♪

235
00:12:41,920 --> 00:12:43,920
♪We made a promise long ago♪

236
00:12:44,240 --> 00:12:45,840
♪To stay together until the end of time♪

237
00:12:46,520 --> 00:12:49,840
♪You are the fate I cannot escape♪

238
00:12:50,160 --> 00:12:53,000
♪How much must I let go♪

239
00:12:53,320 --> 00:12:55,000
♪For one moment♪

240
00:12:55,280 --> 00:12:58,000
♪To hold each other close♪

241
00:12:58,240 --> 00:13:02,560
♪Would that be enough?♪
